WARNING:MULTILINE_DEREFERENCE: Avoid multiple line dereference - prefer 'priv->rtllib->swcamtable[4].key_buf[0]'
#85: FILE: drivers/staging/rtl8192e/rtl8192e/rtl_cam.c:197:
